# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/next-2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed
# from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image N0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-2 is a PLACEHOLDER: the driver of the window may substitute it (in every template) once the image is built
# from the pushed branch; the driver's IMAGE_TAG env overrides it.
# R2: the correctness arm, c2-packed-tp4-gate-rshard-audit: the AUDITED production shape (c2-packed-tp4: both verify audits on, the tail caps)
# plus QWEN_FAST_REQUEST_SHARD_ARGMAX=1 and QWEN_FAST_REQUEST_SHARD_AUDIT=1. Each request verify trace also runs the pinned sampler beside
# the shard argmax; every row of every sequential step is compared on the host and the pinned sampler's ids are what is served, so this
# arm cannot change a token. The tests are the production smoke of the tp4-serve-6 window (B5), unchanged and in N0's order.
# The lever (QWEN_FAST_REQUEST_SHARD_ARGMAX=1, verifier_engine_tp.py): the request engine's rows=1/2/4 verify traces pick tokens with the
# packed block's per-chip shard argmax (an argmax and a max on each chip's own vocab shard, combined on the host) instead of the pinned
# sampler, so those traces bake no sampler AllGather, untilize or ArgMax. Hypothesis: the audits-off hang (the first replay of a request's
# rows=2 verify trace after many packed rounds) needs the pinned sampler's AllGather in that trace.
# SCOPE: this base carries the tail caps (QWEN_FAST_BUDGET_CAP=1), under which ordinary traffic drafts four rows to the end and never replays
# a rows=1 or rows=2 capture, so this job audits the width-4 sequential steps only; rows 1 and 2 are audited by R2b (caps off, the hang
# shapes). Do not read this job as covering them.
# Read: '[PINDIAG] request shard argmax engaged rows=N audit=1' for the widths the engine built; '[PINDIAG] request shard argmax audit exact=True rows=4' (required);
# NO '[PINDIAG] request shard argmax audit mismatch' line anywhere (one is a finding: the combine is not the pinned sampler's rule for
# some input); c2_smoke_check clean with audit_mismatches 0; every concurrent4 hash equal to its concurrent4_solo run.
# OPTIONAL: its product is data. Duration (estimate): 45 min (a smoke of sixteen tests).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-2
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-gate-rshard-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,concurrent4_steady,steady_resend,tool_call,stream_tool_call,stream_reasoning,refused_n2,alive_after_refusal,stream_dropped,alive_after_drop,concurrent4_solo,concurrent4_code,concurrent4_code_equal
